{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d47af6de0de50698","x":420,"y":2920,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"\"I mean, I already knew I wanted to be pregnant someday.\" Emma put a lock of her hair behind her ear, \"Why not today? I man sure the timing isn't what I pictured,\" she shrugged, \"but it's not like I'm in a position where I can't care for a baby. I have you and Jane and Anne to help me through this.\"\n\nBasically Emma pointing out that one more kid is something they can handle together. They have the money and space for it. \n\n\"I mean, maybe this is a bit blunt, but we have the money, we have the space in the house, and I think we have enough people that we have the time.\" As long as she had her family to help and support her, Emma felt like this was doable. "},
		{"id":"716af23c339dbd5c","x":960,"y":2700,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Anne made her way upstairs before call Kaylie. How she missed her voice. \"Hey there you.\" Anne greeted the phone. \n\n\"Hey.\" Kaylie greeted back, then paused, \"Sorry, I just really wish I could touch you, it's been bad today.\" \n\nKaylie was pregnant was well, and was going though a rather horny phase. \"Yeah,\" Anne made her voice low, \"you want to tell me about it?\""},
		{"id":"0409566a0ef2a98c","x":1520,"y":2700,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"\"What's up?\" Kaylie asked over the phone.\n\n\"Well, we've decided to extend the family vacation,\" Anne started.\n\nKaylie bit her lip, but from her face it wasn't nerves.\n\n\"But I was thinking about making a short solo trip back to town,\" Anne paused.\n\nKaylie eyes got big. \n\n\"To see you. If you want to?\" Anne purred, and watch Kaylie melt. \n\n\"Yes please.\" Kaylie moaned. \n\n\"Because I do want to touch you.\" Not as much as Kaylie seemed to, but she did miss seeing Kaylie in person, and not just to touch her. "},
		{"id":"6a543d59ab766efb","x":2140,"y":2700,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Anne moaned as soon as she saw Kaylie on the screen. \n\n\"Guess you got it bad now, hu?\" Kaylie asked, looking down at the phone.\n\nAnne didn't know why, but there was just something about it. She wasn't literally in heat, but boy did it feel like it sometimes. \"So bad. Take off your shirt?\" \n\nKaylie smirked. \"Only because I owe you.\" She playfully teased. Kaylie set her phone as Anne could see more of her body, and them slowly took off her shirt and bra. Anne took in the full curves of Kaylie's breasts, and her belly. All of the above had grown since the last time she'd seen Kaylie. Though Anne supposed her own baby bump had grown too. Things would get tricky as they both came to term, but Anne wasn't about to let that stop her. "},
		{"id":"9abd56b10f0374d4","x":2780,"y":2700,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"It was like Kaylie couldn't keep her hands off Anne's belly. \"That doing it for you?\" \n\nShe sucked in a breath, \"I don't know why, but yes.\" \n\nAnne stroked Kaylie's belly through her shirt, making her shiver and moan. "},
		{"id":"a6780a6a4991d910","x":-500,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Emma grabs a snack of some kind and the other glass of blood fruit, then makes her way to the couch to join Sara in watching the movie she/they picked out. "},
		{"id":"7e5a168f140fec05","x":40,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"With Anne putting Cass to bed, Jane comes out to the living room to join Emma and Sara"},
		{"id":"c19f5f0262e55f77","x":580,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"At some point during the movie, Cass is asleep for the night and Anne slips upstairs to call Kaylie. They miss each other and are looking forward to seeing each other. \n\nAnne doesn't mention that Emma is pregnant, because that's Emma's news to tell, not hers. It's out of respect for Emma, and letting Emma choose who she tells and when. "},
		{"id":"0d4e44360dd9e79d","x":1140,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Jane sees the Emma is sipping on the blood fruit, and maybe Sara whispers to Jane (while Emma is getting a snack?) about how Sara knows that Emma will be fine. "},
		{"id":"ec5a04f21b656007","x":1680,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Emma eats lots of snacks during the movie, getting up to get more now and then"},
		{"id":"ff0aa376042a81eb","x":3180,"y":1940,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Maybe there's never really any grand conversation about, Emma just starts eating food and she's feeling better, so they just roll on almost as if it's always been this way. Because like she's a vampire pregnant with an alien, so whatever is basically how they take it. "},
		{"id":"1cc1e2e3d41a168e","x":3800,"y":840,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Even after the movie, Emma ends up spending most of the night munching on food. As a vampire, she doesn't need that much sleep. None of the adults do, though the cabin is quiet because Cass is asleep. \n\nMaybe something like Emma is in her PJ's in front of the fridge, one hand on the fridge door, the other on her lower abdomen and she finds herself thinking or whispering \"ok you, what sounds good now?\" like as if she's talking to the fetus. Maybe she even thinks something like \"ok, can momma have some blood fruit salad yet? No? You don't want any of that? Maybe some yogurt? Or something more... substantial.\" And Emma eyes some leftovers of something that's more of a heavy hearty meal, and gives it a try. It's a heavy meal, but it feels so good once she's eaten it. She gets a little full for a bit, but before long the hunger returns again. Maybe while she's full, it's almost like she can kinda feel her thirst. Like getting enough food for Brenda is what makes it so she can feel her vampire needs again. \n\nMaybe she hits a moment where she might be full, but still sort of wants to eat, and she's thinking like 'are you sure about this? we've already had a lot.' she eats slowly and carefully, and might start to feel a bit too full, but that's when she can kinda feel her thirst again. She's not sure how she can swallow blood fruit salad at the point, but she actually enjoys part of one until that empty hunger starts to emerge again. Then it's a feeling for regular food.\n\nBasically it only gets painful to eat blood fruit when she's had too much blood fruit compared to food. As long as she feed Brenda enough, then blood fruit doesn't cause her issues. \n\nMaybe she ends up spending most of the night munching and thinking about things like motherhood. I mean she might sleep some, and the house will be quiet because Cass is sleeping, but the four adults are all vampires. They don't need much sleep. A little, but not a lot. Not the whole night. "},
		{"id":"aa158b6305e05c2b","x":4340,"y":1340,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Maybe vampires, with the often all blood diet, have less of that bloating phase of pregnancy, because having their basically empty gut pushed out of the way doesn't really change how they look. Their belly might feel a bit more firm, but not as much as a human's as fast.\n\nThough Emma goes from this vampire state of little bloating, to full on human stretched out quickly since her diet changes quickly. "},
		{"id":"d071b6cb7ebcb741","x":3800,"y":1340,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Eventually Emma gets a bit of sleep, and wakes up hungry and Jane or Sara might find her cooking in the morning. \n \nMaybe Emma looks like she's dressed like normal, her hoodie and jeans. But actually she's slightly more bloated mainly from eating all night, and that's why she's dressed in her trusty baggy hoodie. No one can see that her jeans aren't buttoned, because well she can't close them anymore between her uterus growing and her gut filling with food. Maybe she borrows some waist extenders from Anne? Because Anne wasn't sure if she would need them before their vaca was over, and they take up basically no space to pack. "},
		{"id":"cf5dbca3f3f674f8","x":3800,"y":2780,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Emma wears her hoodie and jeans for at least a few days. Not trying to hide her belly, just being comfy. Because she can tell it's growing, and isn't surprised by that. She's eating a lot of food, and she knows her baby is growing, she can feel more of that stretching in her lower abdomen. \n\nPlus with getting so much food, maybe Brenda has a bit of catch up growth spirt over the next few days. Maybe it's partly from Emma's ability to heal as a vampire? idk. \n\nThen her jeans don't really fit or the fit is getting worse quickly so she doesn't bother getting dressed or wears something else, and to her family it looks like her belly has changed in size nearly instantly. It's not really a true baby bump at that point, but Emma definitely looks different. \n\nMaybe she wears her baggy hoodie for a day or three, so then when she can't even get into her pants, the change in the size of her belly is a bit more sudden seeming to the others. "},
		{"id":"435f8b69abab08ad","x":3800,"y":2280,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"Sara is going to tell them about what she did learn when she was abducted: that aliens are in danger on earth, and they will need to hide Emma's child to protect said child. Maybe that next morning, once Emma decides she wants to go through with the pregnancy, Sara explains that maybe they should extend their vaca and stay out here longer, that way it's less likely that anyone at home would even know Emma was pregnant at all. And therefore not know about Brenda existing"},
		{"id":"a4f26605c4328075","x":3800,"y":1820,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"In the morning, Emma is sitting alone somewhere and thinking, and rubbing her now slightly more bloated belly (from her basically non-stop munching), and basically decides/realizes that yes she wants to carry her pregnancy to term. Like no, now isn't the prefect ideal time for having a child of her own, but she wants to stay pregnant. \n\nEmma tells at least Sara. "}
	],
	"edges":[]
}